---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
bodyClass: home
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-court" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/hero-court.svg" alt="" fetchpriority="high"></div>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Athens, Ohio</p>
    <h1>Building leaders through the sport of volleyball</h1>
    <p class="hero-lede">We are committed to cultivating the complete athlete, nurturing their physical, mental, and emotional well-being for success on and off the court.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button" href="/tryouts-2/">Tryouts</a>
      <a class="button button-ghost" href="/our-philosophy/">Learn more</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Programs</p>
      <h2>Find your place on the court</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      {%- for program in programs %}
      <a class="card" href="{{ program.url }}">
        <span class="card-index">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
        <h3>{{ program.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ program.text }}</p>
        <span class="card-link">{{ program.link }} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-dark">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="split-media">
      <img src="/images/team-photo-1024x579.jpg" alt="Athens Elite team photo" width="1024" height="579" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Our Philosophy</p>
      <h2>Developing the whole athlete</h2>
      <p>We believe success means building the skills to compete, the confidence to lead, and the character to support others—while keeping a love for the game at the center of it all.</p>
      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pillar">
          <h3>Train with purpose</h3>
          <p>Through on-court instruction, strength and conditioning, mental training, and film and statistical analysis, we help athletes understand their game, recognize their progress, and take ownership of their development.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <h3>Lead through actions</h3>
          <p>We teach athletes to communicate, embrace challenges, and contribute to their team. Kindness, accountability, sportsmanship, and respect are expectations we practice every day.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <h3>Find joy in the game</h3>
          <p>We create a positive, competitive environment where athletes feel supported, celebrate one another, and build confidence through effort and growth.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-ghost" href="/our-philosophy/">Read our philosophy</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container cta-band">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">@{{ site.instagramHandle }}</p>
      <h2>Follow us on Instagram</h2>
      <p>See the latest from our teams, clinics, and events.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button" href="{{ site.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow on Instagram</a>
  </div>
</section>
